    "tactics": "",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Slam [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 5 + Melee Combat 2), Reach: 5 ft.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 7 damage (4 + 3 Str).</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 7 damage, DR halved (round up); target makes Fortitude save (1 success) or knocked Prone.</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Submerge: As a [Move] action, the Stone Lurker submerges into natural earth or stone it is standing on. While submerged it is Hidden and moves at its burrow speed. It must surface to attack. Ambush: When the Stone Lurker ### Attacks on the same turn it surfaced from Submerge, it has Fortune on that attack.</p>",
